uffering from a severe form of hysteria and refusing to eat. A compassionate doctor, Carl Gustav Jung, takes her under his care and, for the first time, experiments with the psychoanalytical method of his teacher Sigmund Freud. Thus is born a sweeping story of love and passion, of body and soul, soaring to the utmost heights, but also plunging to the darkest depths of the 20th century."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vi96XZn3t8EEm6B2h4tVm780fHi.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8A7gT7IEq01O0jyiyuv1lYGMNxX.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":47505,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vi96XZn3t8EEm6B2h4tVm780fHi.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vi96XZn3t8EEm6B2h4tVm780fHi.jpg","language":"it","width":683,"height":1025},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vi96XZn3t8EEm6B2h4tVm780fHi.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vi96XZn3t8EEm6B2h4tVm780fHi.jpg","language":"it","width":683,"height":1025},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uDIQ8PxMQYesThg6xjAJzDjhJ9l.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uDIQ8PxMQYesThg6xjAJzDjhJ9l.jpg","language":"it","width":600,"height":900}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"xx":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]}},"background":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"xx":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8A7gT7IEq01O0jyiyuv1lYGMNxX.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8A7gT7IEq01O0jyiyuv1lYGMNxX.jpg","language":"xx","width":1280,"height":720},"candidates":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8A7gT7IEq01O0jyiyuv1lYGM